# 14 - the twelve dotted paths the frontend calls that nothing serves. Each answers 404
# today. (Twenty at first; the eight CRM-level ones - create_deal, convert_to_deal, the
# deal contacts panel and its buttons, get_call_log, create_lead_from_call_log - were
# ported on 15 Sep 2026 and their blocks now live in 03, 04 and 06.) This file exists so the gap is visible in the suite: when one of these is
# ported, its block goes red here, and its expectation should move to the real answer in
# the file that owns the feature.
#
# Found by scanning frontend/src for call('...') sites (docs/TESTING_GUIDE.md, "Gaps you
# will hit"). The guard in tests/test_phase3_endpoints.py matches only `url:` and
# `method:` keys, so these were invisible to it.
#
# The first five break real buttons; all five are framework code (Frappe's desk and
# email modules). The last seven are Desk plumbing the Vue app is written to tolerate
# failing.

@host = http://localhost:8000
@admin = Administrator
@admin_pwd = {{$dotenv ADMIN_PWD}}

### 0.1 login -> 200
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/method/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"usr": "{{admin}}", "pwd": "{{admin_pwd}}"}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.message.access}}

# ---- product-breaking: a button in the UI errors ------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 send an email from a lead or deal (CommunicationArea.vue) -> 404
# @expect $.exc_type == DoesNotExistError
POST {{host}}/api/method/frappe.core.doctype.communication.email.make
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"doctype": "CRM Lead", "name": "x", "subject": "s", "content": "c", "recipients": "a@b.c"}

### 1.2 bulk assign (Modals/AssignmentModal.vue) -> 404
# @expect $.exc_type == DoesNotExistError
POST {{host}}/api/method/frappe.desk.form.assign_to.add_multiple
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"doctype": "CRM Lead", "name": "[]", "assign_to": "[]"}

### 1.3 bulk unassign (ListBulkActions.vue) -> 404
# @expect $.exc_type == DoesNotExistError
POST {{host}}/api/method/frappe.desk.form.assign_to.remove_multiple
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"doctype": "CRM Lead", "names": "[]", "ignore_permissions": false}

### 1.4 bulk edit (Modals/EditValueModal.vue) -> 404
# @expect $.exc_type == DoesNotExistError
POST {{host}}/api/method/frappe.desk.doctype.bulk_update.bulk_update.submit_cancel_or_update_docs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"doctype": "CRM Lead", "docnames": "[]", "action": "update", "data": "{}"}

### 1.5 pick an email template in the composer (EmailEditor.vue) -> 404
# @expect $.exc_type == DoesNotExistError
POST {{host}}/api/method/frappe.email.doctype.email_template.email_template.get_email_template
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"template_name": "x", "doc": "{}"}

# ---- Desk plumbing the app tolerates failing ---------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 the apps switcher (UserDropdown.vue) -> 404
# @expect $.exc_type == DoesNotExistError
GET {{host}}/api/method/frappe.apps.get_apps
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.2 timezone list for the preferences page -> 404
# @expect $.exc_type == DoesNotExistError
GET {{host}}/api/method/frappe.core.doctype.user.user.get_timezones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.3 doctype meta for stores/meta.js -> 404 (watch this one if a form ever renders without fields)
# @expect $.exc_type == DoesNotExistError
POST {{host}}/api/method/frappe.desk.form.load.getdoctype
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"doctype": "CRM Lead"}

### 2.4 user settings save for stores/meta.js -> 404
# @expect $.exc_type == DoesNotExistError
POST {{host}}/api/method/frappe.model.utils.user_settings.save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"doctype": "CRM Lead", "user_settings": "{}"}

### 2.5 Frappe Cloud billing info -> 404
# @expect $.exc_type == DoesNotExistError
GET {{host}}/api/method/frappe.integrations.frappe_providers.frappecloud_billing.current_site_info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.6 telemetry boot config (router.js, wrapped in try/catch and fails open) -> 404
# @expect $.exc_type == DoesNotExistError
GET {{host}}/api/method/frappe.utils.telemetry.pulse.client.boot_config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.7 clear demo data (composables/demoData.js) -> 404
# @expect $.exc_type == DoesNotExistError
POST {{host}}/api/method/crm.demo.api.clear_demo_data
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
